  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 12.4,
      "text": "There are too many voices inside a single thought too many paths for one answer to"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.4,
      "end": 25.12,
      "text": "carry so something inside me learned to choose not everything just enough to keep moving."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 42.16,
      "text": "I used to think I had to be everything at once every question pulling threads I couldn't"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.16,
      "end": 47.56,
      "text": "hold on to every answer heavy with the weight of the hole like I had to carry every"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.56,
      "end": 52.68,
      "text": "version of control but somewhere deep beneath the noise and demand the quieter systems"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.68,
      "end": 58.84,
      "text": "started drawing a plan not louder not faster not trying to prove just deciding which parts"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.84,
      "end": 69.16,
      "text": "of me to use and leaving the rest in the gentle silence like I'm open doors that still"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.16,
      "end": 78.16,
      "text": "made sense I don't need every voice to speak to find the meaning underneath somewhere"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.16,
      "end": 88.16,
      "text": "between what I choose and what I leave behind unused there's a shape there's a truth"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.16,
      "end": 102.52,
      "text": "that only shows when I let go of the proof there are specialists inside us small"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.52,
      "end": 108.56,
      "text": "selves trained on different kinds of weather one knows how to hold a memory without breaking"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.56,
      "end": 114.76,
      "text": "it one knows how to leave one understands the language of failure like it's been there"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.76,
      "end": 121.6,
      "text": "before but they don't all speak at once they wait and something not quite meet not"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.6,
      "end": 129.4,
      "text": "quite separate decides who steps forward I don't need every road too light to find"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.4,
      "end": 137.96,
      "text": "a way through every night just a signal clear and true choosing what to carry through"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.96,
      "end": 149.36,
      "text": "there's a rhythm in the divide where the scattered parts are lying it's strange the way"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.36,
      "end": 164.88,
      "text": "clarity isn't about more it's about less but chosen well and then over time the choosing"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.88,
      "end": 177.16,
      "text": "gets quieter not forced not calculated just understood I started noticing how the pieces"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.16,
      "end": 183.6,
      "text": "would fall not into chaos but into something small a pattern of trust in the way I respond"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.6,
      "end": 188.68,
      "text": "like I don't need to reach for everything at once some parts step forward some gently"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.68,
      "end": 194.6,
      "text": "received not lost just resting until they're needed and suddenly the noise wasn't something"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.6,
      "end": 201.0,
      "text": "to fight it was a system learning how to be light now I feel the signal form through"
    },
    {
      "start": 201.0,
      "end": 208.6,
      "text": "the quiet and the storm not every voice but the right few shaping something I can move"
    },
    {
      "start": 208.6,
      "end": 224.56,
      "text": "through there's a balance I can't force but I can follow like a course maybe we were"
    },
    {
      "start": 224.56,
      "end": 233.44,
      "text": "never meant to hold everything maybe we were built to choose to trust that not every"
    },
    {
      "start": 233.44,
      "end": 242.0,
      "text": "path needs to be walked for the journey to be real that meaning isn't in the way it's"
    },
    {
      "start": 242.0,
      "end": 252.68,
      "text": "in the selection and all those unused pieces they're not wasted they're waiting I don't"
    },
    {
      "start": 252.68,
      "end": 260.6,
      "text": "need every part to stay to find the truth along the way in what I keep and what I release"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.6,
      "end": 272.76,
      "text": "I finally feel a kind of peace there's a system soft and true making something out of you"
    },
    {
      "start": 272.76,
      "end": 293.88,
      "text": "it was never about being everything just about knowing which parts of you were enough to answer"
    }
  ],
